.env*.local

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

# The native projects are committed, not ignored.
#
# `android/` and `ios/` are the build. They are checked in so this is an
# ordinary Android and Xcode project that anyone can clone and build without
# running an Expo command first, and so a change to native config is reviewable
# in a diff rather than hidden inside a generator.
#
# The cost of that choice: `expo prebuild` regenerates these from `app.json` and
# will overwrite hand edits. Edit the native files directly and treat prebuild
# as a one-time bootstrap, or make the change in `app.json` and re-run it.
#
# Only build output is ignored.
/android/build/
/android/app/build/
/android/.gradle/
/android/.idea/
/android/local.properties
/ios/build/
/ios/Pods/
/ios/*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
/ios/*.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
